    <shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="78" width="840" height="28">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" color="rgba(203,213,225,1)">
        <p>能不能把大项目切成短周期，每段都交付可用软件并随时校准方向？</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="116" width="836" height="72">
